Owner: safety-pharmacology-intelligence
Purpose: evidence notes on pitavastatin glycemic profile (NODM/HbA1c/insulin sensitivity, RCT vs
observational), DDI liability (CYP3A4-independence, transporter/OATP1B1, cyclosporine, macrolide,
rifampin, fibrate), and residual-risk pharmacology (Lp(a), ApoB, remnant cholesterol), each tagged
with Evidence Hierarchy. Populated starting Wave 1/2.
